    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 1 hour 15 minutes. The thing to watch is the peanut butter: add it gradually and stir constantly as it goes in. Added too fast over high heat it can seize and turn grainy rather than melting into the soup smoothly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use unsweetened peanut butter with no added oil or sugar. The ones with just peanuts and salt give you the cleanest, most authentic flavour."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
